# No Git LFS (DECISIONS #9). Re-add the filter lines in the same commit that installs git-lfs
# and runs `git lfs migrate import`, never before: a half-migrated repo (old PNGs plain, new
# PNGs pointers) is indistinguishable in a diff. The tracked screenshot weight is
# `du -sh docs/progress` (~150 MB across ~250 files at the time of writing), not a number to
# restate here.

* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.glb binary
*.bin binary
*.pdsts binary
